// 本文件源码取自同一游戏的源码版（033-2 longyunmeng），用 v22pre11 编译器重新编译，与本版的 .b 二进制完全一致。
// Source taken from the source edition of this game (033-2); it compiles to the same program as this edition's .b binary.
// pihuoshang.c

inherit NPC;
inherit F_DEALER;

void create()
{
	set_name("皮货商", ({ "pihuo shang", "pihuo", "shang" }) );
	set("gender", "男性" );
	set("age", 25);
	set("long",
		"这是一位皮货商，他自己也是满身皮裘。\n");
	set("combat_exp", 5000);
	set("attitude", "friendly");
	set_temp("apply/attack", 20);
	set_temp("apply/defense", 20);
	set_temp("apply/armor", 20);
	set_temp("apply/damage", 30);

	set("vendor_goods", ({
		__DIR__"obj/piqiu",
	}));
	set("chat_chance", 20);
	set("chat_msg", ({
		(: random_move :)
	}) );
	setup();
	carry_object(__DIR__"obj/piqiu")->wear();
}
void init()
{	
	object ob; 

	add_action("do_buy", "buy");
	add_action("do_list", "list");
	::init();
}

